+# Pull request
+
+## Summary
+
+<!-- What does this change do, and why? Keep it short but specific. -->
+
+## Type of change
+
+- [ ] Bug fix
+- [ ] New feature
+- [ ] Breaking change
+- [ ] Refactor / cleanup
+- [ ] Documentation
+- [ ] Build, CI, or packaging
+- [ ] Translation
+- [ ] Theme or UI
+
+## Related issues
+
+<!-- e.g. Closes #12, Relates to #34 -->
+
+## How was it tested?
+
+<!--
+List the commands and platforms you tested. Examples:
+- `dotnet build -c Release`
+- `helio auth status`
+- `helio instance select <name>` on Arch Linux
+- Launched a Fabric 1.21 instance with an Ely.by account
+-->
+
+- OS:
+- .NET SDK version:
+- Tested commands:
+
+## Checklist
+
+- [ ] I read `CONTRIBUTING.md`.
+- [ ] The change is focused and does not include unrelated refactors.
+- [ ] `dotnet build -c Release` succeeds.
+- [ ] I tested the affected command(s) manually.
+- [ ] I updated documentation, help text, and translations where needed.
+- [ ] I added no tokens, passwords, personal paths, or other secrets.
+- [ ] New dependencies were discussed in an issue first (if applicable).
+
+## Screenshots / terminal output
+
+<!-- Optional, but very helpful for UI or prompt changes. -->
